  "reflectionText": "John saw a great multitude no man could count, dressed in white robes with palm branches. The elder said: these came out of the great suffering. The Lamb shepherds them, leads them to springs of life-giving waters. God will wipe away every tear from their eyes. What is it to be promised that the Lamb who was slain will be the One who shepherds you to the springs of living water?"
